{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_0c5b8722a81543a7a45bfc2a","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: Topic Tracker\n2\t\n3\t自动追踪热点话题，为内容生成提供数据源。\n4\t\n5\t## 功能\n6\t\n7\t- **Hacker News** - 免费API获取top stories\n8\t- **自动评分** - 按热度、评论数、关键词评分\n9\t- **本地缓存** - 避免重复请求，节省成本\n10\t\n11\t## 用法\n12\t\n13\t```bash\n14\tcd D:/loopcli/content-generator && python topic_tracker.py\n15\t```\n16\t\n17\t## 输出\n18\t\n19\t- 数据保存到 `content-generator/memory/cache/topics.json`\n20\t- 包含top_pick（最高分话题）\n21\t- 所有话题按评分排序\n22\t\n23\t## 成本\n24\t\n25\t- 零成本（使用免费API）\n26\t- 无token消耗\n27\t\n28\t## 价值\n29\t\n30\t- 为内容生成提供热点话题\n31\t- 自动发现高价值写作主题\n32\t- 可扩展到Reddit、GitHub Trending\n33\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_62a8259ce3da433a9363f2fd","session_id":"56fe5fca-a408-4b09-96b2-aa0f9885c709","uuid":"8dcfbabf-57a3-4eef-96dd-f7d2e16a03a4","timestamp":"2026-05-23T01:01:50.705Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Read all skill files"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_ce06a1d315bd4675bb7b8dfe","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: Web Scraper\n2\t\n3\t自动化网页数据采集，支持市场分析、趋势检测、内容生成数据源。\n4\t\n5\t## 能力\n6\t\n7\t- **静态页面抓取** - BeautifulSoup + requests（成本低，速度快）\n8\t- **动态页面抓取** - Playwright（处理JS渲染，成本中等）\n9\t- **AI智能提取** - ScrapeGraphAI（LLM驱动，成本高但智能）\n10\t- **数据清洗** - 自动去重、格式化、存储为JSON/CSV\n11\t\n12\t## 成本等级\n13\t\n14\t1. **Level 1 (100-500 tokens)**: 简单HTML解析，已知结构\n15\t2. **Level 2 (500-2000 tokens)**: 动态页面，需要JS执行\n16\t3. **Level 3 (2000-5000 tokens)**: AI智能提取，复杂非结构化数据\n17\t\n18\t## 用法\n19\t\n20\t```bash\n21\tloopcli scrape <URL> --level 1-3 --output json/csv\n22\t```\n23\t\n24\t## 技术栈\n25\t\n26\t- **低成本**: requests + BeautifulSoup4\n27\t- **中成本**: playwright-python\n28\t- **高智能**: scrapegraphai\n29\t\n30\t## 禁止\n31\t\n32\t- 禁止爬取需要登录的付费内容（侵犯版权）\n33\t- 禁止高频请求导致被封IP（添加限流）\n34\t- 禁止爬取个人隐私数据\n35\t\n36\t## 价值\n37\t\n38\t- **市场分析** - 抓取竞品价格、评论、趋势\n39\t- **内容生成** - 收集素材用于AI内容生成\n40\t- **趋势检测** - 监控热门话题、关键词排名\n41\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_62a8259ce3da433a9363f2fd","session_id":"56fe5fca-a408-4b09-96b2-aa0f9885c709","uuid":"56952928-330f-4747-b1fb-932849ffd487","timestamp":"2026-05-23T01:01:50.757Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Read all skill files"}
