{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260523090521b765ab856f5f42c0","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, only the GDD.md exists. I need to create the entire project from scratch. Let me set up the project structure step by step.\n\nLet me plan the implementation:\n\n1. Initialize npm project with package.json\n2. Create tsconfig.json, vite.config.ts, electron-builder.json\n3. Create source files:\n   - src/main/main.ts (Electron main process)\n   - src/renderer/App.ts (game main loop)\n   - src/renderer/Renderer.ts (Canvas renderer)\n   - src/renderer/Camera.ts (camera zoom/pan)\n   - src/game/GameState.ts (immutable state + save)\n   - src/game/Map.ts (grid map 32x32)\n   - src/game/Building.ts (grid placement)\n   - src/game/Resources.ts (manual collection)\n   - src/data/buildings.json (building definitions)\n   - index.html (entry point)\n4. Create necessary config files\n\nLet me start building everything. I'll create files in parallel where possible.\n\nLet me think about the architecture:\n\n**GameState.ts** - Immutable state pattern with a save/load interface\n- Resources (灵石, 灵草, 丹药, 灵气, 修为)\n- Current realm/level\n- Placed buildings\n- Map state\n\n**Map.ts** - Grid-based map\n- 32x32 grid cells\n- Each cell has terrain type\n- Area rendering with camera viewport\n- Support for the starting area (炼气坪 20x15)\n\n**Building.ts** - Building placement system\n- Buildings from buildings.json data\n- Grid placement with validation\n- Building types: mine (矿脉), field (灵田), furnace (丹炉), etc.\n\n**Resources.ts** - Resource management\n- Click spirit stone mine to collect\n- Click spirit grass field to harvest\n- Resource quantities with display\n\n**Renderer.ts** - Canvas rendering\n- 2D rendering with layers\n- Sprite drawing (procedural sprites for now)\n- Grid rendering\n- Building rendering\n\n**Camera.ts** - Camera system\n- Zoom in/out\n- Pan with mouse drag\n- Coordinate transformation\n\n**App.ts** - Main loop\n- 60FPS with requestAnimationFrame\n- deltaTime calculation\n- State management\n- Input handling\n\nLet me create all these files. I'll create them systematically.\n\nFirst, let me set up the project structure:","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1027b7ea-a18e-4300-8be2-f33dc07a79d1","uuid":"70369728-4678-454a-9f4a-b7fbd5ffa472"}
